# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# design.md §9.2 (tasks.md slice 16): build-time .bb delivery bundles — a re-packaging of
# already-tracked compiled assets (client/src/assets/game/avatars/*/layers/*), never a second
# source of truth. Generated by `node scripts/bundle-avatar-packages.cjs <char>` into
# public/bundles/ so Vite copies it into dist/bundles/ on build and vite dev serves it too.
public/bundles

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

.env

# Offline asset-compiler input staging (design.md §3): decrypted source archives, never a
# committed artifact. Compiled output lives under src/assets/game/{avatars,accessories}/.
.assets-src/

# design.md §11 (tasks.md slice 7): generated production-parity metrics JSON, written fresh by
# every `avatar-parity.spec.js` run — a measurement, not a tracked artifact.
e2e/artifacts/*
# tasks.md slice 21: visual contact sheets ARE the deliverable (human review evidence, not
# scratch measurement output) — committed, unlike every other e2e/artifacts/ generator above.
!e2e/artifacts/contact-sheets/
!e2e/artifacts/contact-sheets/**

# Playwright's own run metadata (last-run bookkeeping), never a tracked artifact.
test-results/